&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;OptoSigma Corporation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;OptoSigma Europe S.A.S.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="text_align_justify" style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;OptoSigma Southeast Asia Pte. Ltd&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;上海西格瑪光机有限公司&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
